<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
        <div style="width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#B7E3CF,#9EC5B0);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#04201a">B</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:12px">Hand-mixed blends with clear use notes</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="blends.html">Blends</a>
        <a href="shop.html">Boutique</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="about.html">Story</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="glass">
        <h1>Blends & small kits</h1>
        <p class="intro">Thoughtful combinations designed for short rituals or daily supports. Every label lists suggested dilutions and when to consult professional guidance.</p>
        <div class="cta" style="margin-top:14px">
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px">
            <a id="blendCta" class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class="muted" href="shop.html">Browse retail items</a>
          </div>
          <div class="muted">Contact: {{EMAIL}} · {{PHONE}}</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="grid">
        <div>
          <div style="margin-top:12px" class="blend-list">
            <div class="blend">
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
                <div>
                  <div style="font-weight:700">Evening Ease — 10ml roll-on</div>
                  <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">Lavender, sweet marjoram, fractionated coconut oil. Suggested dilution 3% for topical roll-on.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="badge">Gentle</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="blend">
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
                <div>
                  <div style="font-weight:700">Focus Spark — Diffuser blend</div>
                  <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">Lemon, rosemary, small camphoraceous notes. Intermittent diffuser cycles recommended.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="badge">Portable</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="blend">
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
                <div>
                  <div style="font-weight:700">Grounding Elixir — 15ml</div>
                  <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">Vetiver, patchouli, jojoba. Use diluted for skin; deep base presence in inhalation tools.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="badge">Rich</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="glass" style="margin-top:12px">
            <div style="font-weight:700">How it’s made</div>
            <ol style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">
              <li>Short intake about preferences and safety needs.</li>
              <li>Blend composed and labeled with dilution and patch-test steps.</li>
              <li>Optional small-batch addons for travel and gifting.</li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div class="glass" style="margin-top:12px">
            <div style="font-weight:700">FAQ</div>
            <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">
              <strong>Patch test:</strong> Apply diluted blend to inner forearm and wait 24hrs. Stop if irritation appears.<br>
              <strong>Pets:</strong> Some oils can affect animals; request pet-safe recipes.<br>
              <strong>Pregnancy:</strong> We provide alternatives and avoid contraindicated oils; consult a provider for medical guidance.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside>
          <div class="glass wheel-box">
            <div style="font-weight:700">Aroma wheel — explore notes</div>
            <svg id="wheel2" viewBox="0 0 360 360" style="width:260px;height:260px">
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="t2"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#F9E8E0"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#E3B7A0"/></linearGradient>
                <linearGradient id="m2"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#E8F7F0"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#B7E3CF"/></linearGradient>
                <linearGradient id="b2"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#E8F3FF"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#9BB7D8"/></linearGradient>
              </defs>
              <g transform="translate(180,180)">
                <path d="M0,-140 A140,140 0 1,1 0,140 A140,140 0 1,1 0,-140" fill="url(#t2)"/>
                <circle r="80" fill="url(#m2)"/>
                <circle r="40" fill="url(#b2)"/>
              </g>
            </svg>
            <div class="legend" id="legend2">
              <div data-note="bergamot">Bergamot</div>
              <div data-note="rose">Rose</div>
              <div data-note="vetiver">Vetiver</div>
              <div data-note="lavender">Lavender</div>
            </div>
            <div id="wheelNote" class="muted">Hover a label for more.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="glass" style="margin-top:12px">
            <div style="font-weight:700">Order options</div>
            <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">We offer single blends, sample sets, and an add-on kit of inhalers and roll-on bottles.</div>
